{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13103200","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13103200","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:5:1310320001:1":{"text":"That photo was all scratched up. Seems like that couple had relationship problems...","source_cn":"刚才的照片上都是划痕……油画上那对夫妻，他们的感情似乎...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97C93AF8A5E2297B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310320002:1":{"text":"The text under that photo looks like it was written by the wife... Oh, it's so sad!","source_cn":"那张照片下的文字像是女主人写的，她的丈夫酗酒，酒后打人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5E2CA332D54EE09","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1310320002":{"text":"The text under that photo looks like it was written by the wife... Oh, it's so sad!","source_cn":"那张照片下的文字像是女主人写的，她的丈夫酗酒，酒后打人……唉，这谁能受得了啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5E2CA332D54EE09","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1310320003:1":{"text":"Hmm, the traveler's journal we found earlier said the husband killed her!","source_cn":"唔，我们一进来看到的旅人日记里说那个男主人杀了他的妻子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9CA5D3A91E4B9F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1310320004:1":{"text":"Do you think maybe she was planning to leave him, and in a fit of rage, he did something awful...?","source_cn":"难道是因为他妻子打算和他分手，他一时冲动，就动了手？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x638411A837721C44","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1310320007:1":{"text":"It seems like their love turned into hatred. Chippy wonders how it ends...","source_cn":"看来这是一对夫妻从相爱走向相互憎恨的故事……不知道结局...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AF6AF6A80A21EE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1310320008:1":{"text":"If my interpretation is correct, these clues should help us find and open the door.","source_cn":"如果我们的解读是正确的，这些信息应该能帮助我们找到和打...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C8C83C59DF4E089","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1310320009:1":{"text":"But we're still missing something. Let's keep looking.","source_cn":"不过现在我们知道的还不够多，再四处找找看有没有其他线索吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF124F0BE1E247F87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:0:1":{"text":"The journal said...","source_cn":"那篇日记里说……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x82925ABE8FC78EAE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"The journal said...","female":"The journal said...","variant_male_record_index":"68568","variant_female_record_index":"68569","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1310320005:1":{"text":"It sounds like the wife wanted to take revenge.","source_cn":"他的妻子，似乎想要报复他呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D72F2AC18286974","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1310320006:1":{"text":"But the journal earlier said she ultimately died at his hands...","source_cn":"可我记得旅人的日记里说，他妻子最后死在他的手下……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B7D036BDB93853A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:1:2":{"text":"This tells us one thing...","source_cn":"照片里透露出一些信息","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1799176180FE4E49","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"This tells us one thing...","female":"This tells us one thing...","variant_male_record_index":"68570","variant_female_record_index":"68571","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":2}}